    "cost_closing_html":  "About \u003cstrong\u003e$3.73 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost) for country-fried pork with bacon gravy and mashed potatoes. A meat-and-two plate like this runs $12 to $15 at any Southern diner, and theirs does not come with 13 more servings in the fridge.",
